# Court witness (2026-10-01 consolidation). Positive fixture: only DO may actuate.
@prefix dfcm: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/dfcm#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
dfcm:SELECT a dfcm:Operation ; dfcm:mayActuate false .
dfcm:CONSTRUCT a dfcm:Operation ; dfcm:mayActuate false .
dfcm:DO a dfcm:Operation ; dfcm:mayActuate true .
